problem compiling the very same piece of code.  So I figure there must =
be some difference between the two accounts--but so far they are exactly =
the same.  How do I look at and change the virtual memory for a =
particular user?  Is this a system-wide thing, or can it be set =
differently for each user?  TIA

Jonathan Williams
