From tru64-unix-managers  Fri Jul 27 12:51:25 2001
From: Andrew Tolmie <Andrew.Tolmie () Carltonscreen ! com>
Date: Fri, 27 Jul 2001 12:51:25 +0000
To: tru64-unix-managers
