I have a 2100 system with HSG40 controller and 4 raidsets. A couple of
weeks ago the battery failed as well as a disk drive which was replaced but
all raid sets are currently running as reduced and I have 4 drives which
are not being included in the raidsets. My question, is if I just add these
drives into the reduced raid sets the controller will automatically
reconfigure the raidset to run in normal mode? is there anything I need to
type in to ensure that once I add the drive into a raid set that it uses
that drive to eliminate the "reduced" quality?

