Original question:
Hello listers
I'm running TRU64 4.0 E on an AS 8200, and I trying to install Compaq 
Advanced Server V5.0 ECO2 for UNIX. I don't have any window box acting 
as PDC in the domain, so during asusetup I set my server as primary 
(PDC). Why does the ASU server is not starting? I have not made anything 
else besides asusetup. I download ASU from Compaq web site a few days 
ago, is the installation that have two free connections.
The following was an attempt to start the server:

sunguide1 [/] # net start server
The SERVER service is starting......................................

The SERVER service could not be started.
More help is available by typing NET HELPMSG 6126.
sunguide1 [/] # net helpmsg 6126

The SERVER service could not be started.

EXPLANATION

The SERVER service could not be started due to an error.

ACTION

Use "elfread" administrative command to read the Advanced Server event log
files to determine the cause of the problem. Restart the server after the
problem is fixed.

sunguide1 [/] # elfread system

