Subject: tl891 dlx dlt
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=102653652421856

Hi,

We have a tl891dlx dlt library with two drives on
Tru64 5.1 cluster of two es40 nodes. This also has
a mini-library expansion unit (16 slots). How do we
get the robotic part to work from the command line?
I know this is an over simplified questions, in other
words it takes a lot more to answer than one line.
I know about the mt(1) command, but see nothing in
it to indicate how to get the robotic part to work.
The load/unload don't seem to affect moving a tape
in or out, not to mention moving to a particular slot
on either the main unit or the expansion unit. Before
we actually go an buy software (we are looking at
budget concerns right now), we want to check out the
command line of unix tools.

Thanks,
Cheers,
Douglas

