Hundreds of responses, too many to list here but thanks to all who replied.

I got numerous URLs for many different web sites......

Some of the respondents were even nice enough to send me their binaries!
Thanks.

The most popular response was to check the Compaq Open Source Software
Collection CD. It's in there, in RPM form, (so I had to install RPM first)
but I got it installed and the DBA said it worked on his patch file. (Note
that the zip rpm is only zip, it does not install unzip. There is a separate
rpm for unzip.)

Thanks again to all those who responded!

