 Hi,
 
 we recently bought an expansion to our RA3000 raid array. Due to the
 new disks, we have to perform a firmware upgrade on the base box.
 
 Now there are two ways according to the manual: either using SWCC or
 directly connecting to the controller via a serial link.
 
 The first method failed, since the upgrade menue was not ative. The
 Host system was shut down, of course.
 
 The second method seemed to work, and the controller told, that it
 would receive the new firmware, but instead of taking 10-12 minutes
 the download was not finished at much longer than an hour.
 
 Has anyone encountered such problems? What goes wrong?
 
