on a DS10) using a front-end browser (IE 5), the access to the report =
server does not materialise unless we log in as root on the DS10 console =
and run "xhost+" on it. Also, when we log off from the console, the =
browser reports an error accessing it. Hence, we are forced to keep the =
console logged in with the "xhost" command on it.

